Fonts: the device's own system font. No font files are shipped.

Everything on screen is drawn in code: the orb is a procedural shader written for this project,
the panels are drawn on a canvas. No images, icons, sounds or data from other apps or videos.

The reference reel studied in docs/REEL-ANALYSIS.md was used for its interaction grammar only.
None of its frames, text, graphics or data are in this repository.

Clinical sources are listed in FACTS.md. The Borg scales are © Gunnar Borg; the scale shown here
is a simplified redrawing for teaching.
